- Full Title: Church of Reality- Barbara McClintock on Scientific Mysticism and Plant Consciousness
- Category: #articles
- Summary:: Barbara McClintock, a pioneering cytogeneticist, used intuition and altered states of mind to make groundbreaking discoveries in genetics, showing empathy towards plants and attributing consciousness to them. Despite facing ridicule and rejection from the scientific community initially, McClintock's unique approach eventually led to the acceptance of her work on transposons, earning her a Nobel Prize and solidifying her legacy as a scientific mystic ahead of her time. Her deep connection with nature and her belief in the inner lives of plants set her apart as an outsider in academia, challenging traditional scientific paradigms.
